	(gr_text "Impedance control based on the following stackup:\n\nF.Cu - Layer 1 - 35um / 1 oz Cu - RF Signal\n168 um RO4350B\nIn1.Cu - Layer 2 - 35um / 1 oz Cu - GND\n\n0.2mm FR4 Prepreg\n0.71mm FR4 Core\n0.2mm FR4 Prepreg\n\nIn2.Cu - Layer 3 - 35um / 1 oz Cu - PWR\n200um FR4 Prepreg\nB.Cu - Layer 4 - 35um / 1 oz Cu - Misc/GND\n\nAll tracks on F.Cu (Layer 1) with width 0.307mm shall be matched to 50 Ohms in a \nsingle-ended CPWG configuration (gap to F.Cu GND pour = 0.2mm) referenced to \nIn1.Cu (Layer 2) solid GND plane.\nFabrication may adjust track width and separation as needed to meet impedance."
		(at 100.978 173.178 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "50bef273-329b-46e3-8611-f237f969a644")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
